    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίντης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνομαι</span>) poet.
		word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνις</span>
			, <i>ravening</i>, of the lion, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.481
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.165
			</span></i>; of the wolf, <i><span class="en">
				16.353
			</span></i>: with a fem. Subst., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίνταο φάλαγγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					715
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχις</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				623
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>spoiler, thief</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.602
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				7.115
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>hoopoe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακεσίκρανος</span>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιήτην</span> cod.).</div>
